WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:18.002
here!" Bobby cried.

2
00:00:19.023 --> 00:00:20.504
Jason ran to his friends.

3
00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:22.606
It was summertime.

4
00:00:23.707 --> 00:00:26.489
Everyone was taking a cooking class together at a farm.

5
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.892
Jason couldn't wait to see what they cooked first!

6
00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:33.497
"We're all here now," Nina said.

7
00:00:33.517 --> 00:00:37.379
"Except for Ethan," Izzie said.

8
00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:42.541
"He's having fun surfing in California," Bobby said.

9
00:00:42.561 --> 00:00:47.243
"Well Jason grinned.

10
00:00:47.263 --> 00:00:50.404
"We'll be having fun with a real chef!"

11
00:00:55.006 --> 00:00:56.306
A tall man came over.

12
00:00:56.326 --> 00:00:58.467
"My name is Charles.

13
00:00:58.527 --> 00:01:00.188
But my students call me Chef.

14
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.041
I'll show you junior chefs around the farm.

15
00:01:05.842 --> 00:01:06.302
Follow me."

16
00:01:10.424 --> 00:01:13.086
seems serious," Nina whispered.

17
00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:18.049
"He's a real chef," Jason said.

18
00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:21.491
"So, he is serious—about cooking!"

19
00:01:23.172 --> 00:01:25.373
Several chickens ran around the farmyard.

20
00:01:25.393 --> 00:01:29.736
"Aw!" Izzie saw goats too.

21
00:01:31.932 --> 00:01:34.374
"Look at the cute goats in their pen!"

22
00:01:35.754 --> 00:01:37.295
Chef gave the kids baskets.

23
00:01:38.556 --> 00:01:40.957
"We're making omelets today," he said.

24
00:01:40.977 --> 00:01:43.779
"Let's go to the coop to gather eggs."

25
00:01:46.721 --> 00:01:49.643
At the coop the kids began collecting eggs from nests.

26
00:01:49.663 --> 00:01:53.625
"Be careful not to crack them," Chef said.

27
00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:56.026
"We can't use cracked ones.

28
00:01:56.787 --> 00:01:58.428
And I don't like to waste food!"

29
00:01:59.692 --> 00:02:02.034
A big dog ran up, wagging her tail.

30
00:02:02.054 --> 00:02:04.975
"This is Cinnamon," Chef said.

31
00:02:04.995 --> 00:02:09.698
"At least the dog is friendly," Bobby whispered.

32
00:02:11.299 --> 00:02:13.680
Finally they went into the farmhouse kitchen.

33
00:02:17.342 --> 00:02:19.824
huge," Jason said.

34
00:02:23.066 --> 00:02:23.846
Chef nodded.

35
00:02:23.866 --> 00:02:26.488
"This is my first class for kids.

36
00:02:27.828 --> 00:02:30.450
But He pointed to a poster of kitchen safety rules.

37
00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:34.473
"I expect you to follow the same rules that grown-up cooks follow."

38
00:02:35.874 --> 00:02:37.235
"Chef is mean!"

39
00:02:37.715 --> 00:02:38.515
Izzie whispered.

40
00:02:39.496 --> 00:02:41.617
"No, he's not," Jason said.

41
00:02:42.398 --> 00:02:45.360
Jason saw a recipe for a cheese omelet on a screen.

42
00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:48.602
"That recipe looks easy!"

43
00:02:48.922 --> 00:02:49.663
Bobby said.

44
00:02:50.804 --> 00:02:51.664
Chef frowned.

45
00:02:51.684 --> 00:02:53.726
"It's a simple recipe.

46
00:02:54.526 --> 00:02:56.828
But making an omelet is not easy.

47
00:02:57.692 --> 00:02:59.032
Folding it can be difficult.

48
00:02:59.953 --> 00:03:00.793
Let's get started."

49
00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:05.454
The kids washed their hands and put on aprons.

50
00:03:07.595 --> 00:03:08.996
Nina read the instructions.

51
00:03:09.016 --> 00:03:13.337
"First we have to crack the eggs."

52
00:03:13.357 --> 00:03:15.477
"I'll crack them!"

53
00:03:15.818 --> 00:03:16.558
Bobby said.

54
00:03:16.578 --> 00:03:18.238
"No, no!

55
00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:19.479
Not against the bowl!"

56
00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:20.699
Chef snapped.

57
00:03:20.719 --> 00:03:23.320
"Crack them on a flat surface."

58
00:03:24.756 --> 00:03:27.697
Nina and Bobby carefully cracked two eggs into a bowl.

59
00:03:28.797 --> 00:03:32.898
Bobby added salt and black pepper and whisked the mixture a few times.

60
00:03:32.918 --> 00:03:34.539
"Keep whisking!"

61
00:03:34.899 --> 00:03:35.519
Chef said.

62
00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.200
The eggs were finally ready.

63
00:03:41.341 --> 00:03:43.902
Chef heated a pan on the stove and melted the butter.

64
00:03:43.922 --> 00:03:47.383
"We can add the eggs now."

65
00:03:48.663 --> 00:03:49.823
Nina poured in the eggs.

66
00:03:50.784 --> 00:03:52.044
They cooked for a few minutes.

67
00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.722
Then Izzie sprinkled cheese on one side.

68
00:03:55.742 --> 00:04:00.825
"Now we'll fold half of the omelet over the cheese," Chef said.

69
00:04:00.845 --> 00:04:02.326
"Can I do it?"

70
00:04:02.647 --> 00:04:03.467
Jason asked.

71
00:04:03.487 --> 00:04:05.108
"I know how!"

72
00:04:06.189 --> 00:04:07.830
Chef handed over a spatula.

73
00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.471
"Be careful."

74
00:04:11.293 --> 00:04:13.034
Jason loosened the omelet's edges.

75
00:04:14.475 --> 00:04:16.176
He could feel Chef's eyes on him.

76
00:04:17.016 --> 00:04:19.578
When he tried to fold the omelet, his hand shook.

77
00:04:21.059 --> 00:04:21.900
It broke apart!

78
00:04:22.924 --> 00:04:24.245
"The omelet is ruined!"

79
00:04:25.686 --> 00:04:26.506
Chef sighed.

80
00:04:26.526 --> 00:04:29.468
"Let's just eat it and make another one."

81
00:04:34.851 --> 00:04:37.432
Jason hung his head as Chef passed out servings.

82
00:04:37.452 --> 00:04:40.854
"Izzie's right," he thought.

83
00:04:40.874 --> 00:04:43.315
"Chef is mean."

84
00:04:43.335 --> 00:04:47.178
"Yum!" Nina and Izzie said.

85
00:04:47.198 --> 00:04:50.179
"Best omelet ever!"

86
00:04:50.519 --> 00:04:51.240
Bobby said.

87
00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.723
Something amazing happened.

88
00:04:54.884 --> 00:04:55.786
Chef smiled!

89
00:04:55.806 --> 00:05:00.032
"The omelet doesn't look perfect, but it tastes wonderful.

90
00:05:00.813 --> 00:05:01.294
Good job."

91
00:05:02.215 --> 00:05:04.058
Chef Charles nodded at Jason.

92
00:05:05.219 --> 00:05:07.703
Chef Jason grinned—and took a taste.
